prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above and the grounds set forth hereinabove, the Appellant most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Tribunal may graciously be pleased to:

a) Set aside the impugned order dated {impugned_order_date} passed by the {first_appellate_authority} in {first_appellate_order_no} for Assessment Year {assessment_year};

b) Allow the appeal of the Appellant and direct the Assessing Officer to {specific_direction — delete addition / allow exemption / accept return / consequential relief};

c) Grant consequential relief by way of refund of tax wrongly recovered along with interest;

d) Permit the Appellant to add, alter, amend or substitute any grounds of appeal at the time of hearing of this appeal;

e) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Tribunal may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Appellant shall ever pray.
